    "description": "Voltas Digital Technologies is actively seeking a talented and motivated Plant Manager to join our dynamic team in Gurgaon. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Voltas Digital Technologies:\nVoltas Digital Technologies is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n• Maintain accurate production records and prepare daily reports\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Master's degree preferred\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in PLC/SCADA\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in Lean Manufacturing\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Gurgaon, Haryana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Voltas Digital Technologies!",
